{"id": "1733367", "name": "אינטגרל כפול על חצי אליפסה – קואורדינטות אליפטיות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p></p><p>נגדיר תחום דו-מימדי \\(D\\) להיות התחום החסום על ידי האליפסה</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</p><p></p><p>חיתוך עם חצי המישור</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:1}}\\)</p><p>ונגדיר פונקציה</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">. \\(f(x,y)={{CT:2}}\\)</p><p>חשבו את האינטגרל</p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\">&nbsp;\\(\\iint_Df(x,y)\\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y= \\iint_D{{CT:2}}\\; \\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y\\).&nbsp;</p><p>נבצע החלפת משתנים לקורדינאטות אליפטיות.</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(x=c\\cdot \\cosh(\\mu)\\cos(\\nu),&nbsp;\\quad y=c\\cdot \\sinh(\\mu)\\sin(\\nu)\\)</p><p></p><p>כאשר \\(c\\) הוא הקבוע החיובי המקיים כי \\((c,0)\\) היא (אחד) ממוקדי האליפסה. כלומר&nbsp;</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(c=\\)&nbsp;[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p>&nbsp;ואז נקבל את התחום המוגדר בעזרת</p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\"><span>\\(0\\leq \\nu\\leq \\pi , \\quad 0\\leq \\mu \\leq \\cosh^{-1}(s)\\)<br></span></p><p>כאשר :</p><p></p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(s=\\)&nbsp;[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p><p>ואז מתקיים:&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; direction: ltr;\">\\(\\iint_D {{CT:2}}\\; \\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y=\\iint_Df(x,y)\\mathbf{d}x\\mathbf{d}y=\\)</p><p></p><p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(=\\int_0^\\pi \\int_0^{&nbsp;\\cosh^{-1}(s)} (f(c\\cdot \\cosh(\\mu)\\cos(\\nu),c\\cdot \\sinh(\\mu)\\sin(\\nu)))\\cdot c^2(\\sinh^2(\\mu)+\\sin^2(\\nu))\\;\\mathbf{d}\\mu\\mathbf{d}\\nu=\\)[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]</p><p></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cc", "tans": "ans1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "aa/cc", "tans": "ans2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "epsilon : 10^-6;\ncorrect: is(abs(float(ta) - float(ans3)) < epsilon);\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "ans